        <div class="hero-eyebrow">GOOD FOOD, BETTER MOOD.</div>
        <h1 class="hero-heading">
          BURGERS THAT BRING<br />
          <span class="gold">PEOPLE TOGETHER</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-desc">
          Juicy burgers, crispy fries and unforgettable flavours — made with love, served fresh in under 20 minutes.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-cta-group">
          <a href="/app" class="btn-gold-pill" style="padding: 12px 28px; font-size: 0.95rem;">
            <span>Order Online</span>
            <span>➔</span>
          </a>
          <a href="#catalogo" class="btn-outline-pill" style="padding: 12px 26px;">
            View Menu
          </a>
