          <h2 class="feature-badge-title" style="color: #111111;">
            SWEET<br />
            <span>ENDINGS</span>
          </h2>
          <p class="feature-card-desc" style="color: #6b7280;">
            Because every great meal deserves a sweeter finish.
          </p>
          <a href="/app" class="btn-outline-pill" style="border-color: #111111; color: #111111;">
            <span>View Desserts</span>
